{"_id":"Sh61U9E9Ky4DCAfP","name":"Wildfire Leshy","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/wildfire_leshy.webp","items":[{"_id":"WdlW3hfeQUUeB7Av","name":"Low-Light Vision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.LowLightVision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"low-light-vision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"gCWCgNsZrx3xvkIE":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.fFu2sZz4KB01fVRc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"C3HIGiD5fKqqxGbD","name":"Smoke Vision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Smoke doesn't impair a wildfire leshy's vision; it ignores concealment from smoke</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"gCWCgNsZrx3xvkIE":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"yKFnYzCTgJcRveRq","name":"Burning Body","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":-100000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A wildfire leshy is coated in living flame whose touch can burn other creatures. Any creature that hits a wildfire leshy with a melee attack or otherwise touches the leshy must roll a @Check[type:reflex|dc:16|name:Burning Body DC|traits:evocation,fire,primal,damaging-effect|showDC:gm]{Reflex} saving throw.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes [[/r 1[fire]]]{1 fire damage}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes [[/r 1d6[fire]]]{1d6 fire damage}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes [[/r 2d6[fire]]]{2d6 fire damage} and [[/r 1d4[persistent,fire]]] damage.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire","primal"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"gCWCgNsZrx3xvkIE":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"W6LnyKetHMOgunJf","name":"Water Weakness","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":-50000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When the wildfire leshy starts its turn in water or is doused with water (either through a spell or some other effect, such as pouring a bucket of water over it or being caught in the rain), it takes [[/r 1d8]]{1d8 damage}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"gCWCgNsZrx3xvkIE":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"igtElUCmRkg4XjE5","name":"Fist","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"r9g4nr91iqgmjp67opnp":{"damage":"1d6+2","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":8},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"gCWCgNsZrx3xvkIE":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"q1Rbjle2IBzE9Ixl","name":"Self-Immolate","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wildfire leshy wills its own burning embers to flare up, creating a thick plume of opaque smoke where it stands in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5].</p>\n<p>The wildfire leshy takes [[/r {4}]]{4 points of damage}. All creatures within the affected area are @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all other creatures are concealed to them.</p>\n<p>The smoke persists for 1 minute or until it is dispersed by a strong wind.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire","primal"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"gCWCgNsZrx3xvkIE":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"2GG8oXUu46YnYE1k","name":"At-Will Spells","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AtWillSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"at-will-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"gCWCgNsZrx3xvkIE":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.2